---
import MainLayout from "@/layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Help Center"
  description="Find information about using the NYCUNO platform, account management, troubleshooting, and support."
  currentPage="Help Center"
>
  <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-site flex-1 px-4 py-12.5 sm:px-6">
    <section>
      <h1
        class="relative mb-7 pb-5 font-sans text-[35px] font-medium leading-none text-brand after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-[50px] after:bg-brand"
        data-reveal="up"
      >
        Help Center
      </h1>

      <div class="space-y-5 text-base font-normal leading-[26px] text-[#404040]">
        <p data-reveal="up">
          We are dedicated to providing a comprehensive and user-friendly Help
          Center to assist you in navigating our platform seamlessly. Our Help
          Center serves as a valuable resource for addressing queries, concerns,
          and guiding you through various aspects of the nycuno application.
          Whether you're seeking information about account management,
          troubleshooting, or general inquiries, our goal is to empower you with
          the knowledge needed for a smooth user experience.
        </p>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-text" data-reveal="up">
            Navigating the Help Center:
          </h2>
          <p data-reveal="up">
            Our Help Center is designed with user accessibility in mind. Utilize
            the intuitive navigation to explore a variety of topics and find
            answers to commonly asked questions. From understanding account
            settings to troubleshooting technical issues, the Help Center is
            structured to cater to your needs efficiently. If you don't find
            what you're looking for, our dedicated support team is always ready
            to assist you further.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-text" data-reveal="up">
            Account Management and Security:
          </h2>
          <p data-reveal="up">
            Learn more about managing your nycuno account and ensuring its
            security. The Help Center provides insights into updating personal
            information, password management, and implementing additional
            security measures. Your peace of mind is crucial to us, and we aim
            to empower you with the tools needed to maintain a secure and
            personalized account.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-text" data-reveal="up">
            Troubleshooting and Technical Support:
          </h2>
          <p data-reveal="up">
            Encountering technical challenges? Our Help Center offers a
            troubleshooting guide to address common issues you may face while
            using the nycuno application. Additionally, find information on how
            to reach our technical support team for more personalized
            assistance. We're here to ensure your experience on our platform
            remains smooth and hassle-free.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-text" data-reveal="up">
            Policy and Compliance:
          </h2>
          <p data-reveal="up">
            Stay informed about nycuno policies and compliance standards by
            exploring the relevant sections in the Help Center. From
            understanding our user agreement to privacy policies, this section
            is dedicated to providing clarity on the legal aspects governing
            your interaction with our platform.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-text" data-reveal="up">
            Feedback and Suggestions:
          </h2>
          <p data-reveal="up">
            nycuno values your feedback. If you have suggestions or ideas for
            improvement, our Help Center guides you on how to provide feedback.
            We believe in continuous enhancement, and your insights contribute
            to making nycuno a better platform for everyone.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-text" data-reveal="up">
            Contacting Support:
          </h2>
          <p data-reveal="up">
            Should you require personalized assistance, the Help Center
            provides details on how to contact our support team. Whether it's a
            specific concern or a general inquiry, our support team is
            committed to addressing your needs promptly and effectively. Your
            satisfaction is our priority, and we are here to assist you
            throughout your journey with nycuno.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
